### Programmes visible to the caller (a buyer sees only its own)
GET {{api}}/v1/programs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Availability of a programme
GET {{api}}/v1/programs/{{programId}}/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Current FX quotes (bank roles)
GET {{api}}/v1/fx-rates?to=EUR
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}

### Breaks of a programme (operator, auditor)
GET {{api}}/v1/programs/{{programId}}/breaks
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}

### Open breaks across programmes, including programmes not created yet
GET {{api}}/v1/breaks?open=true
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}
